# =========================================================================
# Project Search & Indexing Ignore Rules (.ignore)
# =========================================================================
# This file directs search/indexing tools (like ripgrep, search engines, and AI agents)
# on what files/directories to skip to keep processing fast and clean.

# =========================================================================
# 🚫 SECTION 1: DO NOT NEED / IGNORED (Skip from indexing and search)
# =========================================================================

# --- Runtime Environments ---
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# --- Python Compiled Cache ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Database & Local Session States ---
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sql
db.sqlite3
data/
**/*.local

# --- Media Uploads & Assets (Heavy Binary Files) ---
# Highly recommended to ignore locally uploaded resumes and recordings from search
**/uploads/
**/audio_uploads/
temp/
tmp/
*.mp3
*.wav
*.mp4
*.webm
*.m4a
*.pdf
*.docx

# --- IDEs & Local Settings ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Logs & Performance Traces ---
*.log
logs/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*


# =========================================================================
# ✅ SECTION 2: CRITICAL FILES & DIRECTORIES TO KEEP (Indexed & Tracked)
# =========================================================================
# The following directories contain the actual application source code and must 
# always be active and searched:
#
# - /frontend-v2/           -> HTML, CSS, JS Frontend source files.
# - /interview-platform/    -> FastAPI Backend, DB schemas, celery tasks, core configs.
# - requirements.txt        -> Python dependencies list.
# - run.py                  -> Main launcher entry point.
# - .env                    -> Local environment secrets template (keep structure, ignore values).
# =========================================================================
